From {{uder|en|fro|disjunction}}, from {{uder|en|la|disjunctio}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/dɪsˈdʒʌŋk(t)ʃən/|/dɪsˈdʒʊŋk(t)ʃən/|a=UK}}
